sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Author
    participant Canvas as Quill Canvas
    participant ChatPanel as AI Copilot Panel
    participant Backend as Express Backend
    participant KeyRotator as KeyRotator Service
    participant Gemini as Gemini 2.5 Flash
    participant Diff as DiffPreview Component

    User->>Canvas: Highlights text segment
    Canvas->>ChatPanel: Emit selectedText event
    User->>ChatPanel: Types prompt (e.g., 'Fix grammar and tone')
    ChatPanel->>Backend: POST /api/ai/chat (prompt, selection, documentContent)
    
    Backend->>KeyRotator: Request active Gemini API Key
    KeyRotator-->>Backend: Returns Key Slot #1
    Backend->>Gemini: Invoke ChatGoogleGenerativeAI
    
    alt 429 Rate Limit Encountered
        Gemini-->>Backend: Error 429 (Quota Exceeded)
        Backend->>KeyRotator: rotateToNextKey()
        KeyRotator-->>Backend: Switches to Key Slot #2
        Backend->>Gemini: Retry with Key Slot #2
    end
    
    Gemini-->>Backend: JSON { message, proposedContent }
    Backend-->>ChatPanel: HTTP 200 { message, proposedContent }
    ChatPanel->>Diff: Render Redline Diff Preview
    
    alt User Accepts Proposal
        User->>Diff: Clicks 'Apply Changes'
        Diff->>Canvas: Replace content state with proposedContent
        Canvas-->>User: Canvas updates with clean applied formatting
    else User Rejects Proposal
        User->>Diff: Clicks 'Discard'
        Diff->>Canvas: Revert to original content
    end
